{"step_index":49,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-17T19:13:20Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Walkthrough artifact summarizing the enterprise transformation of NexusMobility","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Walkthrough: NexusMobility — Enterprise Smart City Platform\n\nThe web application has been completely redesigned, developed, and transformed into **\"NexusMobility — Smart City Carpooling & Eco-Logistics\"**, an enterprise-ready urban mobility platform.\n\n---\n\n## 🌟 Key Transformation Highlights\n\n1. **Zero Technical / Data Structure Jargon**:\n   - Every mention of backend programming terms (e.g. *Stack, Queue, LinkedList, Heap, Hash Table, Dijkstra, BST*) has been **completely removed**.\n   - Re-framed 100% as real-world urban transit operations:\n     - *Dijkstra / Min-Heap* &rarr; **Metropolitan Eco-Route Finder & Corridor Map**\n     - *FIFO Queue* &rarr; **Live Passenger Dispatch Pipeline**\n     - *Circular Queue (Array 5)* &rarr; **Priority Standby Lounge (Max 5 Slots)**\n     - *Singly Linked List* &rarr; **Driver Partner Fleet Directory**\n     - *Hash Table Chaining* &rarr; **Fast Identity & Booking Verification Lookup**\n     - *Doubly Linked List* &rarr; **Active Shared Trips Console**\n     - *Stack LIFO Pop* &rarr; **Revert Last Confirmation (Instant Trip Reversal)**\n     - *BST Visualization* &rarr; **Trip Hierarchy & Corridor Network Canvas**\n\n2. **Refined Corporate Design System**:\n   - **Primary Deep Navy** (`#0B172A`) for structural backgrounds and high-contrast dark panels.\n   - **Eco Mint** (`#20C9B0`) for green transit badges, carbon offset counters, and status indicators.\n   - **Electric Blue** (`#3478F6`) for primary action buttons, illuminated route vectors, and focal highlights.\n   - **Off-White / Crisp Slate** (`#F1F5F9`) for typography using *Inter*.\n\n3. **Subtle & Formal 3D Anti-Gravity Tilt Physics**:\n   - Smooth 60fps mouse-following perspective tilt (`perspective(1000px) rotateX(...) rotateY(...) translateZ(10px)`).\n   - Dynamically elevates cards toward the cursor with soft responsive drop shadows.\n\n4. **One-Click Offline ZIP Exporter**:\n   - Green **\"Export Package\"** button in the header triggers instant client-side `.ZIP` generation via `JSZip` and `FileSaver`.\n\n---\n\n## 📁 Source Files\n- **Application**: [index.html](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/index.html)\n- **Design System**: [styles.css](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/styles.css)\n- **Logistics Engine**: [app.js](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/app.js)\n- **User Guide & Operating Manual**: [README.md](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/README.md)\n","Description":"Created walkthrough.md for NexusMobility","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\Kartik Bhosle\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Writing file","toolSummary":"Create walkthrough.md for NexusMobility"}}]}
